# Environment variables for Claude Code Compass
#
# The MVP (M1) is a static, build-time directory and requires NO environment
# variables. This file exists to document that fact and to reserve names for
# the integrations added in later milestones.
#
# Rules:
#   - Never commit a real .env.local file.
#   - Never prefix a secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_ ; that exposes it to browsers.
#   - Privileged keys stay server-side only.
#
# --- Added in M2: discovery ---
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
#
# --- Added in M3: voting and auth ---
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
